        "guid_hash": "2cfa646dabafcc9fb8f494d5ad8b7214541f575c",
        "summary": "UK government calls on Buenos Aires to end ‘economic pressure’ on islands after international tribunal’s ruling The UK has called on Argentina to stop its economic warfare on the Falkland islands after Buenos Aires failed in a legal attempt to terminate an offshore oil project vital to the future of the British overseas territory. An application by the South American country for suspension of the Sea Lion project was rejected on Saturday by the international tribunal for the law of the seas (Itlos) on the grounds that the issue lay outside its jurisdiction.",
