        "id": 49,
        "title": "Astronomers ‘disheartened’ by decision allowing SpaceX to deploy satellites for space datacenters",
        "source": "The Guardian - Science",
        "source_id": "guardian_science",
        "category": "culture",
        "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/science/2026/nov/27/astronomer-decision-spacex-datacenters",
