        "level": "C2",
        "slot_level": "C2",
        "source_level": "C2",
        "word_count": 666,
        "duration_sec": null,
        "body_text": "Astronomers are pushing back against Elon Musk’s Starmind program to place a huge number of AI computers in space, which was given the green light to proceed by federal communications regulators earlier this week.",
